  m_text: "1. In this study, you will perform 10 different gestures in three directional
    orientations: 0\xB0, 45\xB0, and 90\xB0:\n\r\n2. Watch the video demonstration
    showing the gesture performed in all three orientations.\n\r\n3. After viewing
    the video, perform the gesture ten times in each orientation.\r\n    Please complete
    all repetitions for one gesture before moving on to the next.\r\n"
